WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:03.950
- When I was a kid, I used
to wonder how it was possible

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:07.263
that the Roman Republic could just fall.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.920
The Roman Republic and
the Roman Empire stood

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.150
for hundreds of years, and
yet it all came crashing down.

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:18.130
My history teacher would say,
"The barbarians invaded,"

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:22.100
but in truth, it collapsed
from the inside out

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:26.730
because when Caesar crossed the Rubicon,

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.723
it was clear, the rule of
law didn't matter anymore,

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.600
and that was the beginning of the end

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:39.173
because the rule of law matters.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:44.210
The mission of LegalEagle
is to explain our laws,

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:47.330
to explain how the system
works, when it works.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:48.620
It's not my place to tell you

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:50.910
what policies our
politicians should adopt,

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:54.070
but as a lawyer with an inside
view to our judicial system,

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:56.380
I think I have an insight
into at least this aspect

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:57.340
of our government.

00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:01.270
And over the last four years,
one thing has become clear.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:03.840
President Trump doesn't
care about the law.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:07.470
He's ignorant of the law and
actively subverts the law.

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:10.180
He uses the law for his own
gain and he breaks the law

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:11.550
when it stands in his way.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:14.540
If you care about the
rule of law in America,

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:18.033
you cannot, in good conscience,
vote for Donald Trump.

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:21.400
This video is not about politics per se.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:23.568
It's not about liking or
disliking the legislation

00:01:23.568 --> 00:01:25.100
that President Trump has signed,

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.730
it's not about liking or disliking the way

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:28.750
he has handled the COVID-19 epidemic,

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.580
nor is it about liking
or disliking the judges

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:32.130
that he has appointed.

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:34.160
This video is about the rule of law.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.740
It's about legal equity
and legal equality,

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:38.350
and it's about justice.

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:40.700
And I guess, when the
Scientific American breaks

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.200
with 175 years of tradition to endorse

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.176
a presidential candidate, I guess no one

00:01:45.176 --> 00:01:49.020
including the lawyers, can
stand idly by on the sideline.

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:51.950
So for the first, and
hopefully only time, LegalEagle

00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:54.080
endorses a presidential candidate.

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:56.760
LegalEagle endorses Joe
Biden for president.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:58.700
He is the only candidate that has any hope

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:01.270
of upholding the rule
of law in this country.

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:05.560
Why? Because president
Donald Trump is a criminal.

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:07.770
We know this to an almost certainty.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.690
There's so much evidence
hiding in plain sight

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:13.100
that it's actually
sometimes hard to remember

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:14.650
everything that he's done.

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:19.290
But before we vote in
November, let's at least try.

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:21.180
You might recall that
President Trump is actually

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:23.070
un-indicted co-conspirator individual

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:24.530
number one to the conspiracy

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:26.500
Michael Cohen has already
pleaded guilty to,

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:29.560
